sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App móvil
    participant API as Laravel API
    participant Auth as AuthAlertClass SG
    participant DB as MySQL users

    App->>API: POST /api/customer/login
    API->>Auth: checkAuthorizationApp()
    Auth-->>API: OK / rechazo
    API->>DB: buscar o crear usuario
    API->>DB: generar access_token
    API-->>App: status 1 + user_id + access_token

    Note over App,DB: Requests posteriores incluyen user_id + access_token

    App->>API: POST /api/customer/home
    API->>DB: checkUserAllow(user_id, access_token)
    alt token inválido
        API-->>App: status 4
    else OK
        API-->>App: datos home
    end
